"{\"h1\":\"上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院海南医院\",\"html\":\"<main role=\\\"main\\\" aria-label=\\\"Ruijin Hospital Hainan - National Regional Medical Center\\\" class=\\\"min-h-screen bg-white\\\"><section class=\\\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\\\"><img src=\\\"https://conversation.cdn.meoo.host/conversations/305931829356183552/image/2026-06-08/1780904255817-上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院海南医院.jpeg?auth_key=bc1067b13e330a69cf9520d09adad9678a4d942d8103a9257b1920ac0f2aae6d\\\" alt=\\\"瑞金医院海南医院外观\\\" class=\\\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-950/85 via-teal-950/70 to-cyan-950/80\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\\\"><div style=\\\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\\\"><h1 class=\\\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\\\">上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院海南医院</h1><p class=\\\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\\\">海南博鳌研究型医院</p><p class=\\\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\\\">乐城先行区唯一公立医疗机构 · 国家区域医疗中心</p><div class=\\\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\\\"><span class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\\\">四大特许政策</span><span class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\\\">219项特许药械落地</span><span class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\\\">大病不出岛</span></div><div class=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\\\"><button class=\\\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-cyan-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\\\">了解更多</button><a class=\\\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\\\" href=\\\"/contact\\\">预约咨询</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\\\"intro\\\" class=\\\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\\\"><div class=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center mb-16\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><h2 class=\\\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\\\">医院简介</h2></div><div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-2\\\">2022年</div><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm\\\">正式运行</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-2\\\">500张</div><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm\\\">一期核定床位</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-2\\\">219项</div><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm\\\">落地特许药械</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-2\\\">151项</div><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm\\\">全国首落</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-cyan-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-cyan-600 mb-2\\\">33,000+</div><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm\\\">服务人次</p></div></div><div class=\\\"bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-4\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><p class=\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\\\">上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院海南医院（海南博鳌研究型医院）位于海南博鳌乐城国际医疗旅游先行区，是乐城先行区中唯一一家公立医疗机构，也是国家区域医疗中心。医院于2021年12月试运行，2022年3月正式运行，一期核定床位数500张，二期正同步建设中。</p><p class=\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\\\">医院由海南省人民政府建设，平移上海瑞金医院\\\"技术、人才、管理和品牌\\\"，以海南省人民医院为依托单位，实现与上海总院的医疗同质化。截至2026年3月，已落地219项特许药械及生物医学新技术，其中全国首落151项，服务超33,000人次，并获评全国卫生健康系统先进集体。</p></div></div></section><section class=\\\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\\\"><div class=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center mb-16\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><h2 class=\\\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\\\">关键政策与资源优势</h2><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\\\">依托乐城先行区\\\"四大特许\\\"政策，国际最新获批的药械可在此率先临床应用</p></div><div class=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-600\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"32\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-shield \\\"><path d=\\\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\\\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\\\">特许医疗</h3><p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600\\\">国际最新获批的药械可在此率先临床应用</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-600\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"32\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-activity \\\"><path d=\\\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\\\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\\\">特许研究</h3><p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600\\\">开展前沿医学研究和临床试验</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-600\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"32\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-trending-up \\\"><polyline points=\\\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\\\"></polyline><polyline points=\\\"16 7 22 7 22 13\\\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\\\">特许经营</h3><p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600\\\">引入国际先进医疗管理模式</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"w-16 h-16 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mx-auto mb-4 flex items-center justify-center text-cyan-600\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"32\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-globe \\\"><circle cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\"></circle><path d=\\\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M2 12h20\\\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\\\">特许国际医疗交流</h3><p class=\\\"text-sm text-gray-600\\\">促进国际医疗合作与交流</p></div></div><div class=\\\"bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-600 to-teal-600 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\\\">沪琼优质医疗资源强强联动</h3><p class=\\\"text-cyan-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto\\\">除平移上海瑞金医院超千名\\\"候鸟式\\\"专家往返坐诊外，还与海南省人民医院深度合作。2024年上半年门诊量已达15,000人次，近3年内已有超过400名上海瑞金专家往来于沪琼两地手术、查房与坐诊。</p></div></div></section><section class=\\\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\\\"><div class=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\\\"><div class=\\\"text-center mb-16\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><h2 class=\\\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\\\">优势治疗项目</h2><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\\\">全面平移上海瑞金医院的优质医疗资源，重点围绕三大重点学科群开展高品质诊疗服务</p></div><div class=\\\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-cyan-50\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\\\"><span class=\\\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\\\">国际创新药械通道</span><h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-cyan-700\\\">肿瘤及血液学科群</h3><p class=\\\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\\\">借助乐城特许药械政策，患者可用上全球最新抗癌药物和尖端设备</p></div><ul class=\\\"space-y-3\\\"><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-cyan-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"></path><path d=\\\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\\\"></path></svg><span>胰腺、肝胆及后腹膜肿瘤的外科治疗与转化治疗形成独特优势</span></li><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-cyan-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"></path><path d=\\\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\\\"></path></svg><span>可开展机器人辅助下的高难度微创手术</span></li><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-cyan-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"></path><path d=\\\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\\\"></path></svg><span>血液内科在淋巴瘤、多发性骨髓瘤、急慢性白血病等诊疗领域经验丰富</span></li><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-cyan-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"></path><path d=\\\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\\\"></path></svg><span>可开展CAR-T细胞免疫治疗等前沿技术</span></li></ul></div><div class=\\\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-7 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow border border-cyan-50\\\" style=\\\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\\\"><div class=\\\"mb-5 flex flex-col gap-3\\\"><span class=\\\"w-fit px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full\\\">心血管介入领先</span><h3 class=\\\"text-2xl font-bold leading-tight text-cyan-700\\\">心脑血管和代谢学科群</h3><p class=\\\"border-l-4 border-[#7CB342] pl-4 text-base font-medium leading-relaxed text-gray-700\\\">以高血压、冠心病、心律失常等心血管疾病为特色</p></div><ul class=\\\"space-y-3\\\"><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-cyan-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\\\"><path d=\\\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\\\"></path><path d=\\\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\\\"></path></svg><span>冠脉介入诊疗技术在复杂冠脉病变方面处于领先水平</span></li><li class=\\\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"non